  m_Text: When the gear handle is set UP, the retraction actuator drives the linkage
    and the gear swings forward and up into the nose gear bay. The animation plays
    the full cycle (extend - retract) in a loop. Use Next to follow each stage; the
    parts that do the work stay in colour.
