  m_Text: 'The nose landing gear supports the forward fuselage on the ground, steers
    the aircraft during taxi and retracts forward into the nose gear bay in flight.
    Select a heading to isolate that subassembly in the 3D view: it keeps its own
    colours and the rest of the gear turns transparent.'
